        <item>
            <title>CryptoNotch 1.1.2</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 15:20:00 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
<h2>CryptoNotch 1.1.2</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Permissionless Global Hotkey:</strong> Replaced legacy event monitoring with native Carbon hotkey registration, enabling instant system-wide toggling without requiring macOS Accessibility permissions.</li>
  <li><strong>Updated Default Shortcut:</strong> Changed shortcut to <code>Option + Shift + C</code> (<code>⌥⇧C</code>) for effortless one-handed ergonomics and conflict-free operation with window managers.</li>
  <li><strong>Status Menu Badge:</strong> Added visual <code>⌥⇧C</code> badge to the companion status menu.</li>
</ul>
            ]]></description>
